QSimScan (Quick Similarity Scanner)

Utilities for fast biosequence similarity search.

Authors:
  Denis Kaznadzey
  Vlad Novichkov
  Victor Joukov

Publications: 
NSimScan: https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/btw126
PSimScan: https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0058505

Copyright (c) 1998-2026, SciDM (Scientific Data Management)

License: 
  MIT license (see LICENSE.txt).

Requirements:
  GCC/G++ version 4+

Compatibility:
  Linux
  Windows
  Windows-Cygwin

Presently 2 utilities are released:
  nsimscan for comparing nucleic acid sequences
  psimscan for comparing protein sequences

To build, run 'make' in root directory

